 "result": "Call order (the view's return value flows down to the cookie write):\n\n1. `full_dispatch_request` (`src/tessel/app.py`, ends at ~line 1019) calls `finalize_request(ctx, rv)`. The error path at line 948 calls it too, with `from_error_handler=True`.\n2. `Tessel.finalize_request` (`src/tessel/app.py:1021`) calls `make_response(rv)`, then `finalize_reply`.\n3. `Tessel.finalize_reply` (`src/tessel/app.py:1394`) runs the `after_request` functions. It then calls `session_interface.persist_session(self, ctx._get_session(), response)` at line 1416, unless the session is a null session.\n4. `persist_session` (`src/tessel/sessions.py:337`) is the cookie-backed session interface's implementation. It does the following:\n   - Reads the cookie settings from the `get_cookie_*` helpers.\n   - Calls `cookie_needs_write`.\n   - Calls `get_expiration_time`.\n   - Serializes the session with `make_signer(app).dumps(dict(session))`.\n   - Calls `response.set_cookie(...)` at line 374.\n   - Calls `response.delete_cookie(...)` instead if the session was emptied.\n\nThe base-class stub is at `sessions.py:263`. `src/tessel/testing.py:177` also calls `persist_session`, in the test-client helper.",
